<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/webpage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Uniform Resource Locator (URL) that can be used to locate a resource, as defined in [RFC 9110](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc9110/) Section 4.2.1 or Section 4.2.2. It may include an optional fragment identifier as specified in [RFC 3986](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc3986) Section 3.5."@en .
